  "solution": "**Given**:\n\n346 ∶ 175 ∶∶ 250 ∶ ?\n\n**Logic:** Second no. = [(First no. ÷ 2) + 2]\n\n**'346 : 175' →**\n\n⇒ [(346 ÷ 2) + 2]\n\n⇒ [173 + 2] = 175\n\nSimilarly, for '250 :?' →\n\n⇒ [(250 ÷ 2) + 2]\n\n⇒ [125 + 2] = **127**\n\nHere, **'250: 127'** is the correct pair.\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"127\".\n\n49:T60",
